flowchart TD
    A[C_MOVE Received] --> B[Enqueue to RoomActor JobQueue]
    B --> C{Finite + Bounds Check}
    C -->|Fail| R0[Drop Packet]
    C -->|Pass| D{IsSeqNewer?}

    D -->|No| R1[Drop Rewind/Duplicate]
    D -->|Yes| E[ComputeDtSec]
    E --> F{CheckSpeed2D}

    F -->|Too Fast| G[Clamp Position]
    F -->|OK| H[Use Requested Position]

    G --> I[GameMap ValidateMove]
    H --> I

    I -->|Blocked| J[Slide/Correct or Drop]
    I -->|Pass| K[Server Position Commit]
    J --> K

    K --> L[Zone/AOI Update]
    L --> M[S_MOVE Broadcast]
    M --> N[SetMoveStamp]
